---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Contact from '../components/Contact.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';

const manualImages = {
    cover: '/hero-main.jpg',
    chapterBusiness: '/hero-work.jpg',
    chapterGrowth: '/hero-life.jpg',
    chapterFamily: '/hero-main.jpg'
};
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>赖先生使用手册 | Brendon Manuals</title>
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="zh-CN" href="https://brendonlai.com/manuals" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://brendonlai.com/en/manuals" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://brendonlai.com/manuals" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+HK:wght@300;400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="font-sans leading-relaxed selection:bg-hk-accent selection:text-white bg-white text-hk-text">
    <Header />
    <main class="pt-28">
        <section class="px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto pb-16">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.28em] text-hk-accent mb-5">BRENDON MANUALS</p>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-hk-primary leading-tight mb-6">真正的答案，不在别人手上</h1>
            <p class="text-stone-600 max-w-3xl text-lg">
                我们成长中听过太多应该，忙着活成别人版本的成功。这个页面会沉淀工具、知识与反思，帮助你写出属于自己的说明书。
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto pb-12">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
                <div class="bg-hk-primary text-white rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">The Real Answers Aren't in Someone Else's Handbook</h2>
                    <p class="text-stone-200 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Change is the only constant, and perfection is an illusion. Instead of chasing flawless decisions, we move forward by practicing, reflecting, and iterating.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-stone-200 leading-relaxed">
                        这里不会替你做决定，但会给你方法、角度与灵感，让你在复杂世界里更清楚自己要走的路。
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 overflow-hidden min-h-[300px]">
                    <img src={manualImages.cover} alt="手册封面图片" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto pb-24">
            <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-8">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-hk-primary">章节预览</h2>
                <p class="text-stone-500 text-sm">后续可替换为真实文章与案例。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                    <div class="h-40 border-b border-stone-200 overflow-hidden">
                        <img src={manualImages.chapterBusiness} alt="企业出海章节图片" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6">
                        <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-hk-accent mb-2">企业出海</p>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-hk-primary mb-3">1+1 全球化策略实战清单</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">从进入市场评估到落地执行，把可复制的方法变成团队日常。</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                    <div class="h-40 border-b border-stone-200 overflow-hidden">
                        <img src={manualImages.chapterGrowth} alt="个人成长章节图片" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6">
                        <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-hk-accent mb-2">个人成长</p>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-hk-primary mb-3">在变化时代保持长期主义</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">如何在不确定中建立稳定节奏，持续推进你真正重视的目标。</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                    <div class="h-40 border-b border-stone-200 overflow-hidden">
                        <img src={manualImages.chapterFamily} alt="家庭生活章节图片" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6">
                        <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-hk-accent mb-2">家庭生活</p>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-hk-primary mb-3">工作、家庭与自我平衡法</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">把爱、责任与成长放在同一张地图上，不失速也不失温度。</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
    <Contact />
</body>
</html>
